extraction_notes: "Rifts World Book 26: Dinosaur Swamp printed 50-52 (cache p051-p053, cache page = printed folio + 1), read off the OCR and checked line by line against renders of all three pages. Heading on printed 50, the stat block on 51-52. || GROUP: under the section heading New O.C.C.s (printed 47), whose introduction calls the classes variations on the Wilderness Scout; the entry states no S.D.C. base, only +1D6+8 to physical S.D.C., so men_of_arms is false and occ_group is optional, matching the held Wilderness Scout. || XP: the Swamp Stomper, Naturalist and Wild Knives Barbarian column of the Experience Point Tables, printed 74 (cache p075), read off a 300 dpi render; every low bound is the previous high plus one. || BONUSES: printed as Special Bonus. +1D6+8 S.D.C., +3 to save vs poisons and disease (toxins_poisons 3, disease 3), and +1 vs Horror Factor at levels 3, 6, 9, 12 and 15 as five at_level entries. || SKILLS: each base is the catalog base plus the printed bonus. Cooking is Cook; Writing is Creative Writing; Track Animals is Track & Trap Animals; Pilot: Kayak/Canoeing is Boat: Paddle Types/Canoe/Kayak; Speak Native Language at 98% is Language: Native Tongue; Literacy Native Language is Literacy: Native Language. The three printed either/or pairs are choose-one groups carrying the printed bonus. || HAND TO HAND: Expert costs two related skills and Martial Arts or Assassin three, dearer than the other scouts, as printed. || RELATED: count 6 with floors of one Physical and two Wilderness; the schedule is three at level 3 and one each at 5, 6, 9 and 12. Horsemanship prints General +10% and Exotic Animals +5%, so it is two entries. Medical prints Sea Holistic Medicine, transcribed as printed; Holistic Medicine is already an O.C.C. skill. Pilot prints +10% to Kayak/Canoeing and Bicycling only, so Pilot is two entries. Technical prints +10% generally and +15% to Art, Breed Dogs, Falconry, Lore and Language, so it is two entries; the catalog files Falconry